(5177096, 753700, 102126, '<td valign="top">Huge dilemma: I actually love everything about this shot, it''s visually stunning and very well captured - congratulations. Shame you would submit it under a theme that doesn''t suit it at all; there''s nothing unlucky behind the shot, the mood or even the concept. In fact, we can''t even tell he''s in captivity. It would''ve been such a great entry under "free study! (and my vote would''ve been a lot higher). Brilliant shot though :)</td>', 'Huge dilemma: I actually love everything about this shot, it''s visually stunning and very well captured - congratulations. Shame you would submit it under a theme that doesn''t suit it at all; there''s nothing unlucky behind the shot, the mood or even the concept. In fact, we can''t even tell he''s in captivity. It would''ve been such a great entry under "free study! (and my vote would''ve been a lot higher). Brilliant shot though :)', '2009-01-07 05:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
