(5190054, 753700, 75034, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Jason on your first ribbon. I''m sure there are many more in your future. Great photo. You did a great job of finding something uniquely different to submit for this challenge that totally meets the definition of unlucky, from the point of view of the orangutan. It would truly be unlucky to be captured and not in the wild for her I would think.<br/> <br/>All the best to you and yours.<br/> <br/>MAX!</td>', 'Congratulations Jason on your first ribbon. I''m sure there are many more in your future. Great photo. You did a great job of finding something uniquely different to submit for this challenge that totally meets the definition of unlucky, from the point of view of the orangutan. It would truly be unlucky to be captured and not in the wild for her I would think. All the best to you and yours. MAX!', '2009-01-14 01:40:28.000000', NULL, 0),
