(5190087, 753504, 48389, '<td valign="top">Hi Lucus, I am very glad to read that this is a setup scene...obviously it was well done as it made me feel uncomfortable. I think, certainly for me, having had a loved one go through an extremely traumatic death it touched a nerve with me an that may well have been why I left the comment I did...</td>', 'Hi Lucus, I am very glad to read that this is a setup scene...obviously it was well done as it made me feel uncomfortable. I think, certainly for me, having had a loved one go through an extremely traumatic death it touched a nerve with me an that may well have been why I left the comment I did...', '2009-01-14 02:28:08.000000', NULL, 0),
