(5190312, 753700, 34938, '<td valign="top">I cannot for the life of me believe that was your first ribbon Jason...and with 6.4, has to be some kind of record. I bet you had no clue this was going to happen. A superb image and one for the favourites folder...congrats</td>', 'I cannot for the life of me believe that was your first ribbon Jason...and with 6.4, has to be some kind of record. I bet you had no clue this was going to happen. A superb image and one for the favourites folder...congrats', '2009-01-14 06:03:29.000000', NULL, 0),
